    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上，当 $x=-4.6$ 时，有$\\frac{12}{x}=\\frac{12}{-4.6}\\approx-2.6$， $x+2=-4.6+2=-2.6$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 44,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0050#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当 $x=2.6$ 时，有$\\frac{12}{x}=\\frac{12}{2.6}=4.6$， $x+2=2.6+2=4.6$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 44,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0050#9"
      ]
    }
